# Root build context — used by services that build from `..` (the repo root):
#   jmeter-metrics-consumer (dockerfile: jmeter-metrics-consumer/Dockerfile)
#   jmeter-local-orchestrator (dockerfile: jmeter-local-orchestrator/docker/Dockerfile)
# Without this, `docker build` would ship node_modules, every target/, and the
# local backup tarball to the daemon. Keep the context lean and reproducible.

# Build output (regenerated inside the image)
**/target/
**/dist/
**/node_modules/

# VCS / IDE / OS
.git/
**/.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
**/.DS_Store

# Secrets / env (never bake into an image layer)
.env
**/.env.local

# Runtime / logs / diagnostics
**/.runtime/
**/tmp/
**/heapdumps/
*.log

# Local backups
*.checkpoint.*.tar.gz

# Docs — not needed in any build context
docs/
